## Related success criteria 

* [1.4.2 Audio Control (A)](1.4.2.html) is another non-interference criterion which requires that autoplaying audio can be controlled or stopped.
* [2.3.1 Three Flashes or Below Threshold (A)](2.3.1.html) is another non-interference criterion which requires that videos do not flash more than 3 times per second, unless it is below a particular threshold.
* [2.2.1 Timing Adjustable (A)](2.2.1.html) relates to content with time limits – it requires that non-essential time limits can be turned off or adjusted.

